1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,562
Make, see, hear and help take a bare infinitive in the active, but in the passive the to comes back.

2
00:00:06,562 --> 00:00:10,585
They made him work overtime: he was made to work overtime.

3
00:00:10,585 --> 00:00:14,153
I saw him enter the shop: he was seen to enter the shop.

4
00:00:14,153 --> 00:00:17,539
And let becomes be allowed to: he was allowed to go.

